      "text": "## Key Innovations: Why Each Matters"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:botany:00-overview, git-history:botany:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "botany/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "botany/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:botany:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "botany",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "botany",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Botany - Overview: The Plant Kingdom",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Innovation | When | Problem Solved | Consequence |\n|-----------|------|----------------|-------------|\n| **Cuticle** | ~470 Mya | Desiccation on land | Land colonization possible |\n| **Stomata** | ~470 Mya | Gas exchange through cuticle | CO₂/O₂ exchange regulated |\n| **Vascular tissue** | ~430 Mya | Water/nutrient transport over height | Trees possible |\n| **Lignin** | ~400 Mya | Structural rigidity | Forests, coal formation |\n| **Seeds** | ~350 Mya | Embryo protection, dispersal | Freed from wet habitats |\n| **Pollen** | ~350 Mya | Male gamete delivery without water | Reproduction freed from water |\n| **Flowers** | ~130 Mya | Pollinator-directed mating | Explosive speciation |\n| **Fruits** | ~130 Mya | Animal-dispersed seeds | Seed dispersal economy |\n| **Double fertilization** | Angiosperms | Nutritive endosperm only when fertilized | More efficient seed provisioning |"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#008",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
