        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Botany - Overview: The Plant Kingdom",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The Cretaceous angiosperm explosion (~130-66 Mya) diversified flowering plants from minor players to ecological dominants. Modern forests, grasslands, and all agricultural systems are angiosperm-dependent."
    },
