        "id": "maxim:botany:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "botany",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "botany",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Botany - Overview: The Plant Kingdom",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPLANTS                              ANIMALS\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nAutotrophs (make own food)          Heterotrophs (consume food)\nCell wall (cellulose)               No cell wall\nChloroplasts (photosynthesis)       No chloroplasts\nLarge central vacuole               No comparable organelle\nIndeterminate growth (meristems)    Determinate growth\nTotipotency (most cells)            Pluripotency limited\nImmobile (mostly)                   Mobile\nModular body plan                   Fixed body plan\nSecondary metabolites as defense    Behavioral/immune defense\nNo nervous system                   Nervous system (most)\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nCritical shared feature:\nBoth use the same genetic code, ATP currency, membrane chemistry.\nLast common ancestor ~1.5 Bya.\n```"
    },
