      "text": "Giant sequoia (Sequoiadendron):     84 m height, 1,385 tonnes biomass\nCoastal redwood (Sequoia):          116 m height — tallest living organism\nPando quaking aspen (Populus):      43 hectares, 80,000 stems, one clone\nWolffia (duckweed):                 0.1 mm — smallest flowering plant\nRafflesia arnoldii (parasite):      1 m diameter flower, no roots/leaves"
