      "text": "```\n00-OVERVIEW (this file) — phylogeny, key innovations, tissue systems\n    │\n    ├── 01-PLANT-CELL-PHYSIOLOGY — cell wall, chloroplast, vacuole, water potential\n    ├── 02-ROOTS-SOILS — architecture, mycorrhizae, nitrogen fixation, soil ecology\n    ├── 03-STEMS-WOOD — primary/secondary growth, cambium, dendrochronology\n    ├── 04-LEAVES-PHOTOSYNTHESIS — C3/C4/CAM, Rubisco oxygenase, light reactions\n    ├── 05-FLOWERS-REPRODUCTION — pollination syndromes, double fertilization, dispersal\n    ├── 06-TREES-FORESTS — stratification, succession, old-growth, disturbance\n    ├── 07-BIOMES — tropical/temperate/boreal/Mediterranean/grassland/desert\n    ├── 08-PLANT-DEFENSES — alkaloids, terpenes, phenolics, glucosinolates\n    └── 09-ECONOMIC-BOTANY — timber, fiber, medicinals, rubber, dyes\n```"
